  "story": {
    "title": "Monkey and the Drought",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "The rains did not come. The land was very dry.",
      "This monkey left home to look for water and food.",
      "She walked over hills and valleys.",
      "She came to a place named Tirkol.",
      "Monkey was very happy in this place.",
      "She ate fruit and got fat. But she missed her friends.",
      "So Monkey made the long journey home.",
      "The other monkeys were joyful to see her.",
      "\"Where is this wonderful place with fruit?\" they asked her.",
      "\"I will take you there,\" said Monkey.",
      "The other monkeys loved Tirkol. They decided to stay there forever.",
      "But the monkeys from Tirkol were worried.",
      "\"These new monkeys will eat all our fruit,\" they said.",
      "The Tirkol monkeys went to attack the new monkeys.",
      "\"Why fight?\" asked an elder. \"There is enough fruit for all!\"",
      "This was true. So the monkeys decided to live together peacefully."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "The rains did not come.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trời không mưa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The land was very dry.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đất rất khô."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This monkey left home to look for water and food.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con khỉ này rời nhà đi tìm nước và thức ăn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She walked over hills and valleys.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy đi bộ qua đồi và thung lũng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She came to a place named Tirkol.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy đến một nơi tên là Tirkol."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Monkey was very happy in this place.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khỉ rất vui ở nơi này."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She ate fruit and got fat.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy ăn trái cây và trở nên mập mạp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But she missed her friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng cô ấy nhớ bạn bè của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So Monkey made the long journey home.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vì vậy, Khỉ đã thực hiện chuyến đi dài về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The other monkeys were joyful to see her.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những con khỉ khác rất vui mừng khi gặp cô ấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Where is this wonderful place with fruit?\" they asked her.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Nơi tuyệt vời có trái cây này ở đâu?\" chúng hỏi cô ấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I will take you there,\" said Monkey.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tôi sẽ đưa các bạn đến đó,\" Khỉ nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The other monkeys loved Tirkol.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những con khỉ khác yêu thích Tirkol."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They decided to stay there forever.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng quyết định ở lại đó mãi mãi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But the monkeys from Tirkol were worried.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng những con khỉ từ Tirkol đã lo lắng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"These new monkeys will eat all our fruit,\" they said.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Những con khỉ mới này sẽ ăn hết trái cây của chúng ta,\" chúng nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The Tirkol monkeys went to attack the new monkeys.",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những con khỉ Tirkol đã đi tấn công những con khỉ mới."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Why fight?\" asked an elder.",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tại sao phải đánh nhau?\" một con khỉ già hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"There is enough fruit for all!\"",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Có đủ trái cây cho tất cả!\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This was true.",
        "paragraph_index": 15,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Điều này là đúng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So the monkeys decided to live together peacefully.",
        "paragraph_index": 15,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_15139/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vì vậy, những con khỉ quyết định sống cùng nhau hòa bình."
      }
    ]
  },
